# The `core/{src,tests}/**/*.ts` -> `eslint --fix` step is deliberately absent
# from the lint-staged config in package.json.
#
# This repo builds with the TypeScript 7 native compiler. typescript-eslint
# refuses to load against TS 7.0 and throws before linting a single file, so the
# step could not pass on any commit touching core sources - it blocked all work
# on the library rather than catching anything. `pnpm lint` fails for the same
# reason and is expected to until upstream support lands.
#
# Restore the step (and this hook to a bare `pnpm lint-staged`) once
# typescript-eslint supports the TypeScript version in core/package.json:
# https://github.com/typescript-eslint/typescript-eslint/issues/10940
pnpm lint-staged
